{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>הירא</b> Two times in the Masorah: this one and the other הירא ורך הלבב. Just as there, he feared from a transgression that is in his hand, so too here, they feared from transgressions that were in their hand. From here they said: The slain of Egypt were the good ones, for it is written הירא את דבר ה' and juxtaposed to it וירד עליהם הברד ומתו."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:17.725052588Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}